08231                           
08231                           TitleScreenMode:
08231 AD 72 07                        lda OperMode_Task
08234 20 04 8E                        jsr JumpEngine
08237                           
08237 CF 8F                           .dw InitializeGame
08239 67 85                           .dw ScreenRoutines
0823B 61 90                           .dw PrimaryGameSetup
0823D 45 82                           .dw GameMenuRoutine
