08FBC                           
08FBC                           DefaultSprOffsets:
08FBC 04 30 48 60 78 90 A8 C0         .db $04, $30, $48, $60, $78, $90, $a8, $c0
08FC4 D8 E8 24 F8 FC 28 2C            .db $d8, $e8, $24, $f8, $fc, $28, $2c
08FCB                           
08FCB                           Sprite0Data:
08FCB 18 FF 23 58                     .db $18, $ff, $23, $58
