0E404 6A                               ror                         ;rotate carry to MSB of A
0E405 4A                               lsr                         ;and effectively move high nybble to
0E406 4A                               lsr                         ;lower, LSB which became MSB will be
0E407 4A                               lsr                         ;d4 at this point
