0EF45                           PlayerGfxProcessing:
0EF45 8D D5 06                         sta PlayerGfxOffset           ;store offset to graphics table here
0EF48 A9 04                            lda #$04
0EF4A 20 BE EF                         jsr RenderPlayerSub           ;draw player based on offset loaded
0EF4D 20 E9 F0                         jsr ChkForPlayerAttrib        ;set horizontal flip bits as necessary
0EF50 AD 11 07                         lda FireballThrowingTimer
0EF53 F0 25                            beq PlayerOffscreenChk        ;if fireball throw timer not set, skip to the end
0EF55 A0 00                            ldy #$00                      ;set value to initialize by default
0EF57 AD 81 07                         lda PlayerAnimTimer           ;get animation frame timer
0EF5A CD 11 07                         cmp FireballThrowingTimer     ;compare to fireball throw timer
0EF5D 8C 11 07                         sty FireballThrowingTimer     ;initialize fireball throw timer
0EF60 B0 18                            bcs PlayerOffscreenChk        ;if animation frame timer => fireball throw timer skip to end
0EF62 8D 11 07                         sta FireballThrowingTimer     ;otherwise store animation timer into fireball throw timer
0EF65 A0 07                            ldy #$07                      ;load offset for throwing
0EF67 B9 07 EE                         lda PlayerGfxTblOffsets,y     ;get offset to graphics table
0EF6A 8D D5 06                         sta PlayerGfxOffset           ;store it for use later
0EF6D A0 04                            ldy #$04                      ;set to update four sprite rows by default
0EF6F A5 57                            lda Player_X_Speed
0EF71 05 0C                            ora Left_Right_Buttons        ;check for horizontal speed or left/right button press
0EF73 F0 01                            beq SUpdR                     ;if no speed or button press, branch using set value in Y
0EF75 88                               dey                           ;otherwise set to update only three sprite rows
0EF76 98                        SUpdR: tya                           ;save in A for use
0EF77 20 BE EF                         jsr RenderPlayerSub           ;in sub, draw player object again
