0EFBE                           ;$00-$01 - used to hold tile numbers, $00 also used to hold upper extent of animation frames
0EFBE                           ;$02 - vertical position
0EFBE                           ;$03 - facing direction, used as horizontal flip control
0EFBE                           ;$04 - attributes
0EFBE                           ;$05 - horizontal position
