0F0E3 A0 01                             ldy #$01                     ;otherwise load offset for big player swimming
0F0E5 B9 07 EE                  ShrPlF: lda PlayerGfxTblOffsets,y    ;get offset to graphics table based on offset loaded
0F0E8 60                                rts                          ;and leave
